# Socket.IO Chat Server Documentation

## Server Overview

This is a real-time chat server built with Socket.IO, Express, and Prisma ORM connecting to a MySQL database. The server supports both anonymous and authenticated connections via JWT tokens.

**Server Port:** 3031 (configurable via PORT environment variable)

